{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NjSensPgXkJZMx2ABxNArq","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_6/projects/faith-evidence-ie/ideas.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Idea Inbox\\\\n\\\\n## 待验证\\\\n\\\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 A**：增大 KL 系数（0.001→0.04）+ 扩大 LoRA rank（r=4→r=16）+ 降低 lr 至 1e-6。文献调研表明 GRPO+QLoRA 低秩+低KL 是已知不稳定组合，这是最低成本的修复。\\\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 B**：分层 Reward 设计——将单一 reward 分解为 format_reward + entity_reward + relation_reward，消除 reward hacking 捷径。参考 RL-Struct (arXiv 2512.00319) 的层级约束方法。\\\\n- [2026-05-14] **GRPO 遗忘缓解方案 C**：集成 Qwen 团队的 Online Merging Optimizer (arXiv 2405.17931)，在 GRPO 每步将 LoRA 更新方向锚定在 SFT 附近，训练中在线缓解 alignment tax。\\\\n## ACTIVE\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 484, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6ErCXqTustc7s6d8dbtet","session_id":"72bdb13e-4703-43e0-b0b0-f41e588f3f9b","uuid":"636962ab-15b8-4a8b-97dd-196430234add","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:31:08.254Z"}
