{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011ahMLpZUnegjmhySu4A1wB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_6/projects/faith-evidence-ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# faith-evidence-ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 12:03 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP kickoff: complete_mvp() 完成，paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml 已写，dream_simulate 已启动\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nFREIGE: 用 CED (Contrastive Evidence Discrimination) 作为离线质量信号，通过 RSFT (Rejection Sampling Fine-Tuning) 训练 LLM 在文档级关系抽取中同时生成抽取结果和可验证证据。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-15 通过，complete_mvp() 已调用）\\\\n- **MVP-1** ✅ CED signal: margin=0.4827, acc=81.5%, r=0.34\\\\n- **MVP-2** ✅ RSFT+CED: 4/4 configs PASS (rel_f1 +3.9~6.0pp, evi_f1 +1.1~2.1pp, EDCR -4.8~7.7pp vs SFT)\\\\n- **GRPO 判死** (D031/D033): 3 种 reward × 多 lr 全线 catastrophic forgetting\\\\n- **Paper framing**: POST-MVP, Core Claims 4 条 (详见 paper_framing.md)\\\\n- **Experiment plan**: 10 个研究实验 + 4 个 MVP 已完成 (详见 experiment_plan.yaml)\\\\n- **Dream 模拟**: dream_20260515T120227 运行中 (full review mode)\\\\n- **覆盖率**: P0 实验 4 个（0/4 完成），等 Dream 回调后批准启动\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- Primary: **EMNLP 2026 Main** (ARR July cycle)\\\\n- Stretch: ARR May 25（极紧，仅在实验全部顺利时考虑）\\\\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 模拟完成，按回调行动指令处理\\\\n- [ ] Dream 达标后批准 P0 实验启动\\\\n- [ ] plan_001: CED vs flat-NLI RSFT ablation (Claim 2 核心)\\\\n- [ ] plan_002: Test set evaluation\\\\n- [ ] plan_003: EDCR cross-method diagnostic table\\\\n- [ ] plan_004: DREEAM baseline reproduction\\\\n- [ ] 处理 3 个运行中实验结果 (maxtok1536 eval, s43 eval, CED reranker)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 分配（2026-05-15 实况）\\\\n\\\\n| GPU | 状态 | 任务 |\\\\n|-----|------|------|\\\\n| cuda:0 | 🏃 | mvp2_ced_reranker_poc (plan_005) |\\\\n| cuda:1 | 🏃 | mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b_maxtok1536 (truncation 诊断) |\\\\n| cuda:2 | 🏃 | mvp2_eval_rsft_s43_r2 (第 3 seed 方差) |\\\\n| cuda:3 | ⏳ | 待分配（Dream 完成后派 P0 实验） |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 硬件: 4× RTX 5090 32GB (rtx5090-4x)\\\\n- MVP 已消耗: ~80+ GPU-hours (GRPO ~60h + RSFT ~20h)\\\\n- Research P0 预估: ~34h\\\\n- Research P1 预估: ~50h\\\\n- Research P2 预估: ~12h\\\\n- 总预算充裕\\\\n\\\\n## 评审笔记（原始，Research 阶段逐条处理）\\\\n1. ✅ CED 重框定为 anti-reward-overoptimization mechanism（paper_framing.md 已体现）\\\\n2. ✅ EDCR 升格为独立评估贡献 (Claim 4)\\\\n3. ✅ NLI lexical overlap bias → MVP-1 验证 r=0.34\\\\n4. ⬜ Evidence 评测 apple-to-apple 对齐（RC3，Research 阶段实现）\\\\n5. ⬜ Baselines 扩展到 6+（已规划 8+ baselines）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-15 | D040: MVP 正式通过 → 进入 Research 阶段。paper_framing.md 定 | mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b, mvp2_eval_rsft_r1, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44 |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-15 | D039: RSFT+CED ablation 全部 PASS MVP-2——方法鲁棒，1 epoc | mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a, mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b, mvp2_eval_rsft_r1, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44 |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-15 | D038: 撤回 D037——RSFT \\\\\\\"灾难性失败\\\\\\\"实为 eval bug（50-doc pred | mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44, mvp2_rsft_train_r1 |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-15 | D037: RSFT 全线 FAIL（rel_f1=0.0483），pivot 到 CED-as-r | mvp2_rsft_train_r1, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s43, mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44 |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-15 | D034 撤销：diversity crisis 是监控 bug，非生成质量问题，T=0.7 下 d | mvp2_rsft_generate |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-15 | 暂停 RSFT 并行化：Reviewer critical 发现 diversity=1.0/8 是 | mvp2_diversity_probe, mvp2_rsft_generate |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-15 | D034: RSFT diversity 危机——diversity=1.0/8 因 tempera | mvp2_rsft_generate, mvp2_diversity_probe |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-15 | D031 最终确认：GRPO+QLoRA 全线 FAIL，lr5e6 全 6 checkpoint  | mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt100, mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt80, mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt60, mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt40, mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt20, mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-15 | Kill GRPO 训练 (cuda:0 step 113/200): 轨迹数据已充分，释放 GPU | mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1, mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt80 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-14 | GRPO+QLoRA P0 方向判死：ckpt-40 rel_f1=0.0071（比 ckpt-20 | mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt40_r2, mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt20, mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1, ced_kl001_r4 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3570, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FH5S2cu3nnffnASZJkb5cF","session_id":"72bdb13e-4703-43e0-b0b0-f41e588f3f9b","uuid":"a51854fe-ad5f-48ac-8da9-8b96f34bbb9d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T12:31:28.378Z"}
